        "tabs": [
          {
            "text": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Open culture.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "In Resilience.Earth we believe in open culture. We share our knowledge through our methodologies, research and tools under free licenses so that they can be used and improved by other people and groups under the same conditions that we have done. You will find all the resources published in the \"Disruptive Tools\" section, if you have any questions about the use of the tools you can contact us at info@resilience.earth",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "title": "Open culture",
            "titleHeading": "h2",
            "alias": "Overture",
            "media": null,
            "styles": null,
            "c2a": {
              "text": "Disruptive tools",
              "href": "https://w.resilience.earth/tools-disruptives",
              "target": null,
              "cssClass": "btn btn-dark btn-dark-border-white btn-100 mt-4 zw-100 btn-with-arrow-right",
              "page": null
            },
            "verticalScroller": null
          },
          {
            "text": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The Balanç Social and MEC.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The ",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "url": "https://xes.cat/balanc-social",
                    "type": "link",
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Balanç Social",
                        "type": "text"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " It is a tool of accountability and measure of social, environmental and good government impact driven by the Solidarity Economy Network (XES) of which Resilience.Earth is part of. With this balance we audit and evaluate systematically, objectively and periodically the economic functioning and policy of profit; gender perspective; equity and internal democracy; environmental sustainability; social commitment and cooperation; and the quality of work. ",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "url": "https://api-w.resilience.earth/uploads/Balanc_social_resilience_earth_2024_849ad8de5a.pdf",
                    "type": "link",
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "",
                        "type": "text"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "In addition, Resilience Earth is committed to internal transparency with members in all matters affecting the cooperative, by presenting annual general reports, annual financial reports, annual budgets, annual operational plans and the evolutionary strategic plan. To accompany this process we have created the Cooperative's Evolution Manual, an agile, transparent and coordinated tool for internal work.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "title": "Transparency",
            "titleHeading": "h2",
            "alias": "Transparency",
            "media": null,
            "styles": null,
            "c2a": {
              "text": "Results Social Balance 2024",
              "href": "https://api-w.resilience.earth/uploads/Balanc_social_resilience_earth_2024_849ad8de5a.pdf",
              "target": null,
              "cssClass": "btn btn-dark btn-dark-border-white btn-100 mt-4 zw-100 btn-with-arrow-right",
              "page": null
            },
            "verticalScroller": null
          },
          {
            "text": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Social Justice and Equity.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "In Resilience.Earth we understand social justice and equity as essential foundations for ecosocial transformation. We work to regenerate relationships between people and the territory, focusing on the healing, diversity and community sovereignty. We engage ourselves with an intersectional and decolonial look that questions privileges, dismantles polarization, excluding power structures and opens spaces for the voice and leadership of historically oppressed groups. This includes constantly reviewing our practices, relationships and decision-making processes. We are committed to real equity within the team and in our alliances: with transparency in resource distribution, encouraging power decentralization, shared roles and creating safe, accessible and horizontal workspaces.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "We work for a deep regeneration that not only replenishes our environmental impact, but repairs and healthy deep social and cultural wounds, walking towards life models worthy of all people.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "title": "Social Justice and Equity",
            "titleHeading": "h2",
            "alias": "Social Justice and Equity",
            "media": null,
            "styles": null,
            "c2a": null,
            "verticalScroller": null
          }
        ]
